4398/pexels-photo-3184398.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=1600',technology:'https://images.pexels.com/photos/3861969/pexels-photo-3861969.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=1600'};
const solutions={
'black-soldier-fly-systems':{title:'Black Soldier Fly Systems',tag:'Circular bioeconomy',img:images.soil,intro:'Production systems that transform organic resources into valuable biological materials while supporting waste reduction and green enterprise.',options:['Breeding and nursery units','Larvae grow-out systems','Harvesting and material handling','Training, installation and technical support']},
'hydroponic-systems':{title:'Hydroponic Systems',tag:'Controlled-environment agriculture',img:images.hydro,intro:'Soilless crop-production systems designed around available space, water, crop choice, operating capacity and commercial objectives.',options:['Nutrient Film Technique','Deep Water Culture','Drip and media-based systems','Vertical and household systems']},
'aeroponic-systems':{title:'Aeroponic Systems',tag:'Precision root-zone production',img:images.greenhouse,intro:'Root-zone misting systems for propagation, nursery production and efficient controlled-environment agriculture.',options:['Low-pressure aeroponics','High-pressure aeroponics','Nursery and propagation systems','Monitoring and maintenance support']},
'aquaponic-systems':{title:'Aquaponic Systems',tag:'Integrated fish and crop production',img:images.hydro,intro:'Recirculating systems that combine fish production, plant production and biological filtration in one managed ecosystem.',options:['Fish and crop integration','Biofiltration and water circulation','System sizing and crop planning','Training and technical support']},
'climate-smart-farm-systems':{title:'Climate-Smart Farm Systems',tag:'Resilient production',img:images.farm,intro:'Integrated farm designs that improve water efficiency, protected cultivation, biological input use and climate resilience.',options:['Protected production','Efficient irrigation','Water harvesting','Environmental monitoring']},
'demonstration-farms':{title:'Demonstration Farms',tag:'Learning and validation',img:images.farm,intro:'Practical spaces for farmer learning, technology demonstration, product validation and youth enterprise development.',options:['Technology demonstrations','Farmer field days','Institutional learning sites','Youth enterprise incubation']},
'training-capacity-building':{title:'Training & Capacity Building',tag:'Skills for green enterprise',img:images.training,intro:'Practical programmes for farmers, young people, institutions and technical teams adopting sustainable agricultural technologies.',options:['Farmer training','Youth green-enterprise programmes','Institutional workshops','Post-training technical support']},
'agribusiness-consultancy':{title:'Agribusiness Consultancy',tag:'Planning and advisory',img:images.technology,intro:'Technical and commercial advisory for agricultural enterprises, production systems and sustainability projects.',options:['Feasibility studies','Business and production planning','Farm-system design','Technology and sustainability assessment']}
};
const cards=()=>Object.entries(solutions).map(([slug,s])=>`<article class="card"><span class="pill">${s.tag}</span><h3 style="margin-top:16px">${s.title}</h3><p>${s.intro}</p><a class="link" href="/solutions/${slug}">Explore solution →</a></article>`).join('');
const quoteBand=(subject='your agricultural technology requirements')=>`<section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="quote-band"><div><span class="eyebrow" style="color:#8ee2a8">Start a project</span><h2 style="font-size:2.4rem">Discuss ${subject}.</h2></div><div class="btns"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/request-quotation">Get a Quotation</a><a class="btn btn-outline" href="/contact">Contact MarinBio</a></div></div></div></section>`;
const pageHero=(title,lead,img=images.farm)=>`<section class="pagehero" style="--bg:url('${img}')"><div class="container"><div class="crumbs"><a href="/">Home</a> / ${title}</div><h1 class="route-title">${title}</h1><p class="lead" style="color:#d5e6df">${lead}</p></div></section>`;
function home(){const slides=[{t:'Next-Generation Biological Plant Nutrition',p:'Bioactivated technology designed to support healthier soils, stronger rhizospheres and resilient crop production.',img:images.soil,cta:'/biovitalix',c:'Explore BioVitalix B+'},{t:'Turning Organic Waste into Agricultural Value',p:'MarinBio applies biological processing and Black Soldier Fly systems within a circular agricultural model.',img:images.farm,cta:'/solutions/black-soldier-fly-systems',c:'Explore the Circular Model'},{t:'Smart Production Systems for a Changing Climate',p:'Hydroponic, aeroponic and aquaponic systems designed for efficient food production.',img:images.greenhouse,cta:'/solutions',c:'View Farm Systems'},{t:'Building Regenerative Agriculture Together',p:'Partner with MarinBio on research, farmer adoption, technology deployment and youth green-enterprise development.',img:images.training,cta:'/contact',c:'Partner With Us'}];return `<section class="hero" id="hero"><div class="container"><span class="eyebrow" style="color:#8ee2a8">Kenyan biological technology company</span><h1 id="ht">${slides[0].t}</h1><p id="hp">${slides[0].p}</p><div class="btns"><a id="hc" class="btn btn-primary" href="${slides[0].cta}">${slides[0].c}</a><a class="btn btn-outline" href="/request-quotation">Get a Quotation</a></div><div class="dots">${slides.map((_,i)=>`<button class="dot ${i===0?'active':''}" data-slide="${i}" aria-label="Slide ${i+1}"></button>`).join('')}</div></div></section><section class="section"><div class="container split"><div><span class="eyebrow">About MarinBio</span><h2>Biological technology for regenerative agriculture.</h2><p class="lead">MarinBio AgritechSolutions Ltd is a Kenyan biotechnology, circular bioeconomy and climate-smart agriculture company developing biological products, waste-valorization systems, controlled-environment agriculture and future digital support tools.</p><a class="btn btn-dark" href="/about">Discover MarinBio</a></div><img class="media" src="${images.farm}" alt="African agricultural production"></div></section><section class="section soft"><div class="container"><span class="eyebrow">What we offer</span><h2>Integrated solutions for productive, resilient farms.</h2><div class="grid g4">${cards()}</div></div></section><section class="section"><div class="container"><span class="eyeb